OL,3,GNEWSACommunity saves pub from calling
OL,4,Alast orders
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey community has clubbed together
OL,7,Fto save its local pub.
OL,9,FRedhill's Garibaldi pub was run on a
OL,10,Fnon-profit basis by volunteers who
OL,11,Fleased the building, but the property's
OL,12,Fowner opted to put it up for sale in
OL,13,F2024.
OL,15,FThe Garibaldi Community Pub CIC says it
OL,16,Fhas officially brought the freehold of
OL,17,Fthe 150-year-old pub, following a
OL,18,Ffundraising campaign.
OL,20,FManager Shiv Lewis told the BBC she was
OL,21,F"hugely relieved" the group had
OL,22,Fpurchased the pub.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
